OL,3,GNEWSATributes to fallen across North
OL,4,AEast and Cumbria
OL,5,
OL,6,FServicemen, servicewomen and animals
OL,7,Fhave been honoured across the North
OL,8,FEast and Cumbria to mark Remembrance.
OL,10,FDurham Cathedral held its Festival of
OL,11,FRemembrance earlier, which saw music
OL,12,Fand a silent poppy drop, and the
OL,13,FMayor's balcony at Barrow Town Hall was
OL,14,Fadorned with about 5,000 knitted and
OL,15,Fcrocheted poppies.
OL,17,FMeanwhile, a tree carving depicting a
OL,18,Fpigeon, dog and horse was unveiled this
OL,19,Fweek at Ridley Park, in Blyth,
OL,20,FNorthumberland, to honour animals who
OL,21,Fdied in conflicts.
OL,23,APub: 08-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
